    "group": "Burna‑bommer",
    "summary": "As [your opponent's Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) ends, pick a **[visible](vsdata:core-rule/visibility)** enemy unit up to 36\" from this unit, other than **[Lone Operative](vsdata:core-ability/lone-operative)** units and **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** units, and roll a D6. On a 2+:\n\n- that unit takes D3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)\n- that unit is unable to be **[hidden](vsdata:core-rule/hidden)** until your next turn ends\n- ranged attacks against that unit get **[[IGNORES COVER]](vsdata:weapon-ability/ignores-cover)** until your next turn ends",
